{"pin":"BH04421","subcodes":[{"code":"BH04421","anchor":"","first_line":"Once again hath the Phoenix of divine grandeur taken flight, and the Raven of glory hath soared from the western horizon of the soul unto the zenith of hallowed eternity [3.5s]... ...Create in me a pure heart, O my God, and renew a tranquil conscience within me, O my Hope!","first_line_orig":"باز بلند مکنت پرواز نمود و غراب غیرت از مغرب جان متصاعد و باوج عماء قدرت... قلباً طاهراً فاخلق فیّ یا الهی سرّاً ساکناً جدّد فیّ یا منائی  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"210","notes":" \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#494\"\u003eLL#494\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[{"language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"language":"zh-Hans","lang_name":"Simplified Chinese"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"writing_refs":[{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"zh-Hans","lang_name":"Simplified Chinese"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA30:120ax","source":"INBA30","locator":"120ax","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v030/?page=64"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA33:020ax","source":"INBA33","locator":"020ax","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v033/?page=22"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA38:040","source":"INBA38","locator":"040","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v038/?page=42"},{"kind":"music","code":"Ahdieh","source":"Ahdieh","url":"https://ahdieh.bandcamp.com/track/prayer-of-bahaullah"},{"kind":"music","code":"C. McGrail","source":"C","locator":"McGrail","url":"https://youtu.be/0tt2dGnmxw8"},{"kind":"music","code":"Chandra \u0026 Eric","source":"Chandra \u0026 Eric","url":"https://youtu.be/81eJ7ysdrTk"},{"kind":"music","code":"E. Mahony, F. Doomun-Rouhani \u0026 M. Brown","source":